{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_013RWC6sMpbGUoxjcvvN46nX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Claim 1（GRPO universal failure）是论文最强贡献——unpruned reward 0→0.661而accuracy 0pp变化已确认，\n  所有pruned配置叠加training collapse。Claim 2（collapse severity gradient）在主模型成立（RASP step~10 << Standard step~60），\n  但Qwen-Math-7B跨模型证据中RASP与Standard collapse步数重叠，需从\"clean diagnostic\"弱化为\"diagnostic tendency\"。\n  Claim 3（Redundancy-Stability Tradeoff）从fundamental principle降级为\"empirical observation on DeepSeek-R1 family\"——\n  25% SFT gap仅3-5pp（p~0.09），跨模型方向一致但分离度不够。论文仍可投EMNLP Main，但Discussion需诚实承认\n  generalization limitation。Unstructured pruning baseline（plan_017）是关键补充——structured pruning导致collapse而\n  unstructured不会，这直接支持structural damage hypothesis并回应Self-Healing comparison。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  - name: \"Post-prune baselines N=1319 (20%)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: \"将post-prune评估从N=100扩展到N=1319，获得±2.4pp CI用于论文Table 1\"\n    expected_results:\n      unpruned_original_accuracy: 0.854\n      unpruned_original_correct: 1127\n      unpruned_original_n: 1319\n      unpruned_original_stderr: 0.0097\n      rasp_20_postprune_accuracy: 0.298\n      rasp_20_postprune_correct: 393\n      rasp_20_postprune_stderr: 0.0126\n      rasp_20_eos_rate: 0.89\n      rasp_20_avg_len: 782\n      standard_20_postprune_accuracy: 0.261\n      standard_20_postprune_correct: 344\n      standard_20_postprune_stderr: 0.0121\n      standard_20_eos_rate: 0.82\n      standard_20_avg_len: 1145\n      rasp_vs_standard_gap_pp: 3.7\n      rasp_vs_standard_p_value: 0.034\n    result_rationale: >\n      N=100数据（RASP 31%, Standard 27%）的点估计在扩展到N=1319后预计小幅回落——\n      N=100的CI为±9pp，真值可能偏低。CI从±9pp收窄到±2.5pp后，3.7pp gap在post-prune阶段\n      达到弱显著（p=0.034），但这不是论文核心贡献。原始模型85.4%作为pruning damage的参照锚点。\n      Post-prune EOS率差异（RASP 89% vs Standard 82%）反映Standard对generation流畅性的更大破坏。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 1: Post-prune accuracy across methods — RASP 29.8% vs Standard 26.1% vs Unpruned 85.4%\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 2 bar chart第一组: Post-prune accuracy对比，三种方法+unpruned baseline\"\n    analysis: >\n      Post-prune gap（3.7pp）在N=1319下弱显著，确认RASP的CKA-aware selection保留了slightly more\n      functional capacity。但核心意义不在此——pruning后两者都丧失70%+能力，关键在recovery差异。\n\n  - name: \"All recovered models full eval N=1319\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: \"整合所有recovery路径的N=1319评估，构建论文核心Table 2\"\n    expected_results:\n      rasp_sft_accuracy: 0.6149\n      rasp_sft_correct: 811\n      standard_sft_accuracy: 0.5929\n      standard_sft_correct: 782\n      sft_gap_pp: 2.2\n      sft_gap_p_value: 0.25\n      rasp_grpo_step5_accuracy: 0.6065\n      rasp_grpo_step5_correct: 800\n      standard_grpo_step50_accuracy: 0.5891\n      standard_grpo_step50_correct: 777\n      unpruned_sft_accuracy: 0.8127\n      unpruned_grpo_step100_accuracy: 0.8127\n      unpruned_grpo_step100_correct: 1072\n      unpruned_grpo_delta_pp: 0.00\n      grpo_delta_rasp_pp: -0.84\n      grpo_delta_standard_pp: -0.38\n      grasp_sft_accuracy_n1319: 0.395\n      grasp_sft_correct_n1319: 521\n      grasp_grpo_accuracy_n1319: 0.388\n    result_rationale: >\n      已有数据已完整确认核心pattern: unpruned GRPO accuracy=SFT accuracy（1072/1319完全相同），\n      RASP和Standard GRPO均不优于SFT（甚至微降）。GRASPrune post-SFT从N=100的41%在N=1319\n      预计轻微下降至~39.5%（N=100 CI较宽）。GRASPrune post-GRPO预计~38.8%，同样无法从GRPO获益。\n      所有recovery路径都确认Claim 1: GRPO reward-accuracy decoupling is universal。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2: Recovery accuracy matrix — rows=method (RASP/Standard/GRASPrune/Unpruned), cols=recovery (Post-prune/SFT/GRPO)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 2 grouped bar chart: 4 methods × 3 recovery stages，展示pruning damage和recovery trajectory\"\n    analysis: >\n      核心发现已confirm: GRPO在所有配置下都不改善accuracy。SFT gap 2.2pp (p=0.25)不显著——\n      在median tier下报告为\"consistent trend\"而非\"significant result\"。GRASPrune作为external\n      baseline进一步strengthen Claim 1。\n\n  - name: \"GRASPrune full pipeline (20%)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: \"GRASPrune (ACL 2026 SOTA) 20%稀疏度完整pipeline: prune→eval→SFT→GRPO\"\n    expected_results:\n      postprune_accuracy_n1319: 0.068\n      postprune_correct: 90\n      postprune_eos_rate: 0.03\n      postprune_avg_len: 3950\n      post_sft_accuracy_n1319: 0.395\n      post_sft_correct: 521\n      post_sft_eos_rate: 0.96\n      grpo_collapse_step: 18\n      grpo_peak_reward: 0.012\n      grpo_peak_reward_step: 10\n      grpo_final_frac_zero_std: 0.92\n      grpo_final_grad_norm: 0.008\n      post_grpo_accuracy_n1319: 0.388\n      post_grpo_delta_vs_sft_pp: -0.7\n    result_rationale: >\n      GRASPrune的gate-based importance scoring造成最大structural damage（post-prune 7%），\n      因为gate training优化output preservation但不考虑结构冗余——它aggressive地同时移除了\n      important和redundant structures。SFT恢复到39.5%但远低于RASP(61.5%)/Standard(59.3%)，\n      因为deeper structural damage限制了SFT的function redistribution能力。\n      GRPO collapse在step~18，介于RASP(10)和Standard(60)之间——GRASPrune的gate training\n      意外保留了部分redundant结构（它们恰好有低gradient importance），所以比RASP慢collapse，\n      但远不如Standard，因为整体structural capacity太低（39.5% SFT baseline）。\n      Peak reward仅0.012（vs RASP 0.039, Standard 0.065），确认reward signal与starting accuracy相关。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2 新增行: GRASPrune — 6.8% / 39.5% / 38.8%\"\n      - \"Table 3 新增行: GRASPrune collapse step ~18, peak reward 0.012\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 1 新增曲线: GRASPrune GRPO training dynamics (reward, frac_zero_std vs step)\"\n      - \"Fig 2 新增组: GRASPrune recovery trajectory bar\"\n    analysis: >\n      GRASPrune作为ACL 2026 SOTA external baseline强化了论文的generality: 即使最先进的\n      structured pruning method也无法避免GRPO collapse。其collapse timing(step 18)处于\n      RASP(10)和Standard(60)之间，为Claim 2的severity gradient增加了第四个data point，\n      支持collapse速度与structural damage类型的关联性。\n\n  - name: \"Multi-seed post-prune eval (5 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: \"5个随机种子的post-prune评估，建立RASP vs Standard variance estimation\"\n    expected_results:\n      rasp_20_mean_accuracy: 0.304\n      rasp_20_std: 0.028\n      rasp_20_seed_results: [0.31, 0.28, 0.33, 0.29, 0.31]\n      standard_20_mean_accuracy: 0.265\n      standard_20_std: 0.032\n      standard_20_seed_results: [0.27, 0.24, 0.30, 0.22, 0.29]\n      pairwise_gap_mean_pp: 3.9\n      pairwise_gap_std: 2.1\n      paired_t_test_p: 0.024\n      cohen_d: 0.58\n      seeds_used: [42, 123, 456, 789, 1024]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Structured pruning对calibration data敏感——calibration batch的随机性影响哪些structures\n      被选中pruning。5个种子下RASP的variance（σ=2.8pp）略低于Standard（σ=3.2pp），因为\n      CKA-aware scoring提供了额外的稳定性信号（redundancy estimation跨seeds更一致）。\n      Paired t-test p=0.024达到显著，因为paired design消除了seed-level共变量。\n      但Cohen's d=0.58属于中等效应量，不足以称为\"strong advantage\"。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 1 supplement: Mean±std post-prune accuracy across 5 seeds\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix box plot: 5-seed post-prune accuracy distribution, RASP vs Standard\"\n    analysis: >\n      5-seed paired test达到显著（p=0.024），但效应量中等（d=0.58）。在median tier下\n      这支持\"RASP provides a consistent small advantage in structure selection\"，\n      但不足以成为论文主要卖点——核心贡献仍是GRPO collapse phenomenon。\n\n  - name: \"Scoring ablation (magnitude/gradient/random)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: \"20%稀疏度下magnitude-only、gradient-only、random pruning scoring对比\"\n    expected_results:\n      magnitude_only_accuracy: 0.24\n      magnitude_only_eos_rate: 0.78\n      gradient_only_accuracy: 0.28\n      gradient_only_eos_rate: 0.85\n      random_accuracy: 0.17\n      random_eos_rate: 0.45\n      random_avg_len: 2680\n      rasp_ref: 0.31\n      standard_ref: 0.27\n      ordering: \"RASP(31%) > gradient(28%) ≈ Standard(27%) > magnitude(24%) > random(17%)\"\n      cka_marginal_contribution_pp: 3.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Standard ≈ importance(gradient×magnitude)，所以gradient-only(28%)接近Standard(27%)——\n      magnitude信息对gradient已有的信号增量很小。Magnitude-only(24%)丢失了gradient的\n      task-specific信号，退化到只看权重大小。Random(17%)是下界——无信息选择。\n      RASP(31%)相对gradient-only(28%)的3pp增量就是CKA(functional redundancy)的marginal\n      contribution。这3pp很小但方向一致，说明CKA提供了互补但non-dominant的信号。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 6: Scoring ablation — Random(17%) < Magnitude(24%) < Gradient(28%) ≈ Standard(27%) < RASP(31%)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 3 ablation bar chart: 5种scoring方法的post-prune accuracy对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      CKA的marginal contribution仅3pp，说明在post-prune阶段CKA是helpful but not decisive的\n      补充信号。核心pruning quality仍由gradient/importance决定。CKA的关键价值在GRPO collapse\n      differential（Claim 2）而非post-prune accuracy（Claim 3的弱化体现）。\n\n  - name: \"CKA-recoverability correlation analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: \"Per-head F(h) vs post-recovery activation change的mixed-effects regression\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_pearson_r: 0.38\n      overall_p_value: 0.003\n      within_layer_r: 0.22\n      within_layer_p: 0.041\n      between_layer_variance_explained: 0.62\n      within_layer_variance_explained: 0.08\n      mixed_effects_fixed_slope: 0.31\n      mixed_effects_random_intercept_sd: 0.18\n      layer_icc: 0.71\n      control_weight_norm_partial_r: 0.12\n      control_grad_importance_partial_r: 0.15\n      n_heads_analyzed: 224\n    result_rationale: >\n      F(h)（CKA-based functional redundancy score）在层间水平与recovery后activation change\n      显著相关（r=0.38），因为不同层的redundancy基线差异大——早期层功能高度冗余，深层更specialized。\n      但within-layer的预测力弱（r=0.22），因为同层内heads的redundancy差异小，\n      局部connectivity和positional encoding效应主导了recovery dynamics。\n      Layer ICC=0.71意味着71%的variance在层间，仅29%在层内。这解释了为什么CKA-aware pruning\n      （RASP）在post-prune阶段只提供marginal advantage——大部分可利用的信号在层级选择，\n      而RASP和Standard在层级分配上差异不大（都优先剪浅层MLP）。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 9 (Appendix): Mixed-effects regression coefficients\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 4: Scatter plot of F(h) vs ΔActivation, colored by layer depth, with regression line\"\n      - \"Appendix: ICC by layer bar chart\"\n    analysis: >\n      CKA作为recoverability predictor在macro level有效但micro level较弱。\n      这直接支持Claim 3的弱化版本——CKA captures a real signal（r=0.38, p=0.003），\n      但不足以成为\"fundamental principle\"级别的predictor。报告为\"CKA identifies a meaningful\n      but layer-dominated redundancy signal\"。\n\n  - name: \"SFT-only recovery comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: \"RASP vs Standard在SFT-only recovery下的对比（无GRPO）\"\n    expected_results:\n      rasp_sft_20_accuracy: 0.6149\n      standard_sft_20_accuracy: 0.5929\n      sft_gap_20_pp: 2.2\n      sft_gap_20_p_value: 0.25\n      rasp_sft_20_loss_final: 0.64\n      standard_sft_20_loss_final: 0.64\n      rasp_sft_20_token_acc: 0.83\n      standard_sft_20_token_acc: 0.83\n      learning_curve_crossover_step: null\n      convergence_step_rasp: 1400\n      convergence_step_standard: 1350\n    result_rationale: >\n      SFT-only数据已有（RASP 61.49%, Standard 59.29%, gap 2.2pp, p=0.25）。\n      两者训练dynamics几乎完全相同——final loss 0.64, token accuracy 83%——表明\n      SFT的teacher-forcing机制能equally well地利用不同pruning scheme保留的结构。\n      CKA-aware pruning在SFT recovery中的advantage是marginal的：SFT通过梯度下降\n      重新分配功能到remaining structures，不太依赖原始redundancy patterns。\n      Gap方向一致（RASP > Standard）但magnitude不足以达到significance at N=1319。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2 SFT-only列: RASP 61.5% vs Standard 59.3% (p=0.25)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix: SFT training loss curves对比 (RASP vs Standard, nearly identical)\"\n    analysis: >\n      SFT-only comparison确认Claim 3的一半：SFT recovery下RASP advantage是marginal。\n      与GRPO collapse的dramatic差异形成对比——optimal pruning确实depends on recovery paradigm，\n      但SFT方向的evidence弱于GRPO方向。\n\n  - name: \"25% sparsity full pipeline\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: \"25%稀疏度RASP+Standard完整pipeline (prune→SFT→GRPO)，验证sparsity scaling\"\n    expected_results:\n      postprune_rasp_25: 0.21\n      postprune_standard_25: 0.16\n      sft_rasp_25_accuracy: 0.5449\n      sft_rasp_25_correct: 719\n      sft_rasp_25_stderr: 0.0137\n      sft_standard_25_accuracy: 0.5125\n      sft_standard_25_correct: 676\n      sft_gap_25_pp: 3.24\n      sft_gap_25_p_value: 0.089\n      grpo_rasp_25_collapse_step: 7\n      grpo_rasp_25_peak_reward: 0.018\n      grpo_rasp_25_peak_frac_zero_std: 0.97\n      grpo_rasp_25_final_grad_norm: 0.005\n      grpo_standard_25_collapse_step: 30\n      grpo_standard_25_peak_reward: 0.042\n      grpo_standard_25_step30_frac_zero_std: 0.72\n      grpo_standard_25_transient_recovery: false\n      grpo_standard_25_final_reward: 0.028\n      post_grpo_rasp_25_accuracy: 0.535\n      post_grpo_standard_25_accuracy: 0.505\n      collapse_ratio_rasp_vs_standard: 4.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      25%稀疏度放大所有效应：\n      (1) SFT gap从2.2pp扩大到3.24pp（p=0.089）——更多结构移除使RASP的CKA-aware selection\n      产生更大differential effect，但p仍在[0.05,0.15]范围内，属于marginal。\n      (2) GRPO collapse加速——RASP从step~10降到step~7，Standard从step~60降到step~30。\n      两者都因更少structural capacity而更快collapse。但ratio从6x(20%)降到4.3x(25%)，\n      因为Standard在25%下也开始失去redundancy，两者向同一个floor convergence。\n      (3) Standard在25%下不再有transient recovery（20%时step~60 dip后recovered to step~90）——\n      25%的structural capacity不足以支持recovery。\n      这是median tier的核心: collapse gradient存在但\"不如20%那么干净\"。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 1 新增25%行: RASP 21%→54.5%→53.5%, Standard 16%→51.3%→50.5%\"\n      - \"Table 3 新增25%行: collapse steps and dynamics\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 1 新增panel: 25% GRPO training dynamics (reward, frac_zero_std curves)\"\n      - \"Fig 5: Collapse step vs sparsity level line plot (20% and 25%, RASP vs Standard)\"\n    analysis: >\n      25%数据是Claim 2的关键支撑——collapse severity gradient在两个sparsity levels上成立。\n      但ratio compression（6x→4.3x）和Standard失去recovery能力说明gradient在高sparsity下变noisy。\n      SFT gap 3.24pp（p=0.089）是论文能报告的最强SFT evidence——在median tier下报告为\n      \"marginally significant trend (p<0.1) that amplifies with sparsity\"。\n\n  - name: \"30% sparsity probe (prune + eval only)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: \"30%稀疏度RASP+Standard post-prune评估，mapping practical sparsity ceiling\"\n    expected_results:\n      rasp_30_postprune_accuracy: 0.12\n      rasp_30_postprune_stderr: 0.032\n      rasp_30_eos_rate: 0.38\n      rasp_30_avg_len: 2850\n      standard_30_postprune_accuracy: 0.09\n      standard_30_postprune_stderr: 0.029\n      standard_30_eos_rate: 0.31\n      standard_30_avg_len: 3200\n      gap_pp: 3.0\n      gap_p_value: 0.48\n    result_rationale: >\n      30%稀疏度接近structured pruning的实际上限——从25%(RASP 21%, Standard 16%)到30%，\n      accuracy再降约50%。两者都接近random chance on GSM8K（~10-12%可能仅靠简单算术题得分）。\n      EOS率极低（RASP 38%, Standard 31%）表明模型generation能力严重受损，大量输出截断。\n      Gap（3pp）在这个低accuracy下无统计意义（p=0.48），因为variance极大。\n      与D005的35%结果（total collapse）一致——30%是collapse onset，35%是complete failure。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 1 新增30%行: RASP 12% vs Standard 9% (post-prune only)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 5 extended: Sparsity vs post-prune accuracy curve (20%, 25%, 30%), marking practical ceiling\"\n    analysis: >\n      确认~25-30%为DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B的structured pruning practical ceiling。\n      不进行recovery实验因为starting point太低（<15%）。Paper discussion中报告为\n      \"structured pruning beyond 25% is impractical for this model class\"。\n\n  - name: \"Extended eval (MMLU, HumanEval, MATH-500)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: \"最佳recovered config (RASP SFT 20%) + unpruned在三个OOD benchmark上的评估\"\n    expected_results:\n      rasp_sft_20_math500: 0.318\n      rasp_sft_20_humaneval: 0.354\n      rasp_sft_20_mmlu: 0.512\n      standard_sft_20_math500: 0.298\n      standard_sft_20_humaneval: 0.329\n      standard_sft_20_mmlu: 0.498\n      unpruned_sft_math500: 0.524\n      unpruned_sft_humaneval: 0.549\n      unpruned_sft_mmlu: 0.638\n      unpruned_original_math500: 0.558\n      unpruned_original_humaneval: 0.561\n      unpruned_original_mmlu: 0.651\n      recovery_ratio_gsm8k: 0.757\n      recovery_ratio_math500: 0.607\n      recovery_ratio_humaneval: 0.645\n      recovery_ratio_mmlu: 0.803\n    result_rationale: >\n      SFT recovery在GSM8K上恢复到75.7%（RASP 61.5% / Unpruned 81.3%），但OOD benchmark\n      恢复率显著更低：MATH-500仅60.7%，HumanEval 64.5%。这是因为SFT teacher-forcing使用\n      GSM8K gold solutions，recovery部分是GSM8K-specific pattern重建而非通用reasoning能力恢复。\n      MMLU恢复率最高(80.3%)因为factual knowledge主要存储在embedding层和attention patterns中，\n      structured pruning主要移除MLP groups（占pruned structures的100%），对factual recall影响较小。\n      RASP vs Standard gap在OOD上方向一致但magnitude更小（MATH-500: 2pp, MMLU: 1.4pp），\n      说明CKA-aware selection的advantage部分是GSM8K-specific的。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 8: Extended eval — accuracy by benchmark and method\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 6 (Appendix): Recovery ratio by benchmark grouped bar chart\"\n    analysis: >\n      OOD evaluation reveals SFT recovery的domain specificity。核心message: pruned model\n      recovers 75%+ capability on in-domain (GSM8K) but only 60-65% on harder math/code tasks。\n      这strengthens the argument for better recovery methods——current SFT pipeline有inherent limitation。\n      对Claim 3补充了nuance: RASP advantage在OOD上diminishes。\n\n  - name: \"Bonsai baseline (20%)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: \"Bonsai (ICML 2025, gradient-free) 20%稀疏度作为第三个external baseline\"\n    expected_results:\n      postprune_accuracy_n100: 0.19\n      postprune_eos_rate: 0.52\n      post_sft_accuracy_n100: 0.47\n      post_sft_eos_rate: 0.95\n      grpo_collapse_step: 28\n      grpo_peak_reward: 0.022\n      grpo_final_frac_zero_std: 0.88\n      post_grpo_accuracy_n100: 0.46\n    result_rationale: >\n      Bonsai用activation norm作为pruning criterion（gradient-free），post-prune 19%介于\n      random(17%)和Standard(27%)之间——activation norm是importance的粗略proxy但不如gradient准确。\n      SFT恢复到47%，高于GRASPrune(41%)但低于Standard(59%)，因为Bonsai的structure selection\n      质量介于random和gradient-based之间。\n      GRPO collapse at step~28——比GRASPrune(18)慢因为Bonsai的简单norm-based selection\n      意外保留了更多redundant structures（redundant structures often have moderate norms），\n      但比Standard(60)快因为overall pruning quality更差。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2 新增行 (Appendix): Bonsai — 19% / 47% / 46%\"\n      - \"Table 3 新增行 (Appendix): Bonsai collapse step ~28\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix: Bonsai training dynamics curve\"\n    analysis: >\n      Bonsai作为gradient-free baseline补全了pruning method spectrum。四种方法的collapse ordering\n      (RASP 10 < GRASPrune 18 < Bonsai 28 < Standard 60)进一步支持Claim 2: collapse速度\n      与pruning method的redundancy removal aggressive度相关。但Bonsai是P2优先级——\n      如果GPU budget紧张可以drop，GRASPrune足以作为external baseline。\n\n  - name: \"CKA reliability analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: \"Split-half consistency和calibration size sensitivity验证CKA scoring稳定性\"\n    expected_results:\n      split_half_spearman_rho: 0.93\n      split_half_p_value: 1.0e-45\n      cal_256_spearman_rho: 0.88\n      cal_512_spearman_rho: 0.93\n      cal_1024_spearman_rho: 0.95\n      cal_256_accuracy_delta_vs_512: -0.015\n      cal_1024_accuracy_delta_vs_512: 0.008\n      n_structures_scored: 896\n      scoring_time_256_sec: 180\n      scoring_time_512_sec: 340\n      scoring_time_1024_sec: 660\n    result_rationale: >\n      CKA是kernel-based similarity metric，理论上convergence rate为O(1/√n)——512 samples\n      已足够达到ρ>0.9。Split-half consistency ρ=0.93表明在random half-split下scoring order\n      高度稳定。256→512的提升（0.88→0.93）是主要增量，512→1024仅marginal（0.93→0.95），\n      说明512是cost-effective minimum。\n      Accuracy delta确认scoring stability translates to pruning outcome stability:\n      cal=256 vs cal=512仅相差1.5pp post-prune accuracy，cal=1024 vs 512仅0.8pp。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 10 (Appendix): CKA reliability by calibration size\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix: Spearman ρ vs calibration size curve\"\n    analysis: >\n      CKA scoring在512 samples下已稳定（ρ=0.93），支持RASP的practical usability。\n      这是一个defensive result——reviewer可能质疑CKA computation的稳定性，\n      该实验提供conclusive evidence that CKA-based scoring is reliable。\n\n  - name: \"Alpha sensitivity ablation (full)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: \"α ∈ {0, 0.25, 0.5, 1, 2} post-prune和post-SFT accuracy sweep\"\n    expected_results:\n      postprune:\n        alpha_0p0: 0.27\n        alpha_0p25: 0.23\n        alpha_0p5: 0.22\n        alpha_1p0: 0.31\n        alpha_2p0: 0.36\n      post_sft_n1319:\n        alpha_0p0: 0.593\n        alpha_0p25: 0.558\n        alpha_0p5: 0.549\n        alpha_1p0: 0.573\n        alpha_2p0: 0.608\n      post_sft_n100_ref:\n        alpha_0p0: 0.64\n        alpha_0p25: null\n        alpha_0p5: null\n        alpha_1p0: 0.57\n        alpha_2p0: 0.62\n      u_shape_minimum_alpha: 0.5\n      optimal_postprune_alpha: 2.0\n      optimal_postsft_alpha: 2.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Post-prune U-shape已由alpha_ablation_sweep确认（α=0.5最低22%, α=2.0最高36%）。\n      Post-SFT结果部分已有（N=100）——在N=1319下预计：\n      α=0.0(=Standard)→59.3%（已确认），α=1.0→57.3%（从N=100的57%微调），α=2.0→60.8%（从N=100的62%微调）。\n      Post-SFT的U-shape被SFT recovery压缩但保留方向——α=2.0在SFT后仍最优，因为它在post-prune\n      阶段保留了最多functional capacity（36%），给SFT更好的starting point。\n      α=0.25和α=0.5的post-SFT较低是因为它们在post-prune阶段创造了\"noise injection\"效果——\n      CKA penalty太小时反而干扰了importance ranking而不是有效补充。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 4: Alpha ablation — post-prune and post-SFT accuracy across α values\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 3: U-shape curve, dual y-axis (post-prune and post-SFT accuracy vs α)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Alpha ablation是reviewer flagged的Critical experiment。U-shape confirms α是meaningful parameter，\n      不是arbitrary choice。最优α=2.0（非default 1.0）→paper应report this transparently并\n      讨论为什么aggressive CKA penalty有利（推测：更强地保护unique structures在reasoning LLM中更关键）。\n      Post-SFT U-shape压缩但保留说明CKA contribution survives recovery——与plan_008的CKA-recoverability\n      correlation一致。\n\n  - name: \"Inference speedup benchmark\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_016\"\n    description: \"Dense vs 20% RASP-pruned vs 20% Standard-pruned wall-clock latency和throughput\"\n    expected_results:\n      dense_latency_ms: 142\n      rasp_20_latency_ms: 121\n      standard_20_latency_ms: 120\n      rasp_20_latency_reduction_pct: 14.8\n      standard_20_latency_reduction_pct: 15.5\n      dense_throughput_tok_s: 85\n      rasp_20_throughput_tok_s: 99\n      standard_20_throughput_tok_s: 100\n      rasp_20_throughput_gain_pct: 16.5\n      standard_20_throughput_gain_pct: 17.6\n      batch_size: 1\n      seq_len: 512\n      gpu: \"A100-80GB\"\n      n_runs: 50\n      warmup_runs: 10\n    result_rationale: >\n      20% structured pruning移除~19%的parameters（全部是complete MLP groups），理论speedup为19%。\n      实际latency reduction ~15%因为：(1)非MLP compute（attention, LayerNorm, embedding）不变，\n      占总compute的~25%；(2)不同层的pruning不均匀导致GPU utilization不optimal；\n      (3)framework overhead（PyTorch dynamic shapes）。RASP和Standard的speedup几乎相同\n      因为sparsity level相同——pruning method影响which structures被移除，不影响total removal量。\n      Standard微略快（0.7pp）可能是随机variation或因为Standard pruned的structures恰好使\n      layer sizes更uniform。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 7: Inference speedup — latency and throughput comparison\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix: Latency distribution box plot across 50 runs\"\n    analysis: >\n      ~15% speedup在20% sparsity下是reasonable但不impressive——structured pruning的practical motivation\n      需要至少25-30% sparsity才能达到meaningful speedup。但这个experiment是reviewer必问的\n      \"where's the efficiency gain\"的defensive answer。Paper discussion应note that \n      structured pruning实际speedup低于parameter reduction ratio。\n\n  - name: \"Unstructured pruning baseline (20%)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_017\"\n    description: \"Magnitude-based unstructured pruning 20%作为Self-Healing fair comparison基线\"\n    expected_results:\n      postprune_accuracy: 0.682\n      postprune_correct: 900\n      postprune_n: 1319\n      postprune_stderr: 0.0128\n      postprune_eos_rate: 0.98\n      post_sft_accuracy: 0.763\n      post_sft_correct: 1007\n      post_sft_stderr: 0.0117\n      grpo_collapse: false\n      grpo_max_steps: 100\n      grpo_final_reward: 0.548\n      grpo_final_frac_zero_std: 0.32\n      grpo_final_grad_norm: 5.82\n      post_grpo_accuracy: 0.758\n      post_grpo_delta_vs_sft_pp: -0.5\n      grpo_reward_accuracy_decoupling: true\n      structured_vs_unstructured_gap_postprune_pp: 38.4\n      structured_vs_unstructured_gap_postsft_pp: 14.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      Unstructured pruning at 20%仅零化individual weights而不移除structural units——所有224个attention heads和\n      784个MLP groups保持intact。Post-prune 68.2%远高于structured的30%(RASP)/27%(Standard)，\n      因为每个结构仍有80%的weights functional，network topology完全保留。\n      SFT恢复到76.3%——接近unpruned(81.3%)，gap仅5pp，因为结构完整性使SFT只需微调权重而非重建功能。\n      GRPO关键发现：NO COLLAPSE。100步训练stable（frac_zero_std<0.35, grad_norm~5.8），\n      reward达到0.548（vs unpruned 0.661）。但accuracy仍不改善（76.3→75.8, Δ=-0.5pp）——\n      reward-accuracy decoupling在unstructured pruned model上也成立（Claim 1 strengthened），\n      但没有training collapse。\n      这直接支持structural damage hypothesis: collapse是structural pruning的specific consequence\n      （移除entire exploration pathways），不是pruning in general的问题。Unstructured pruning\n      保留了所有structural redundancy，因此GRPO可以stable训练。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2 新增行: Unstructured 20% — 68.2% / 76.3% / 75.8%\"\n      - \"Table 3 新增行: Unstructured — no collapse, 100 steps stable\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 1 新增panel: Unstructured GRPO dynamics (stable reward, no frac_zero_std spike)\"\n      - \"Fig 7: Structured vs Unstructured comparison — collapse is structural-pruning-specific\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是median tier最关键的补充实验。Unstructured pruning确认了两个核心insights:\n      (1) Reward-accuracy decoupling is universal（连unstructured也有reward↑ accuracy=），strengthening Claim 1;\n      (2) Training collapse is structural-pruning-specific（unstructured无collapse），confirming\n      the structural damage mechanism。\n      对Self-Healing comparison: Self-Healing用25% unstructured报告recovery——我们在20% unstructured\n      也看到无collapse，但accuracy仍不从GRPO获益。Paper可argue: Self-Healing的\"RLVR recovery\"\n      可能只是reward improvement without accuracy gain，需要replication with accuracy evaluation。\n\n  - name: \"SFT OOD eval (Standard 20%)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_018\"\n    description: \"Standard SFT 20% (59.29% GSM8K)在MATH-500和HumanEval上的OOD评估\"\n    expected_results:\n      standard_sft_20_math500: 0.285\n      standard_sft_20_math500_stderr: 0.020\n      standard_sft_20_humaneval: 0.305\n      standard_sft_20_humaneval_stderr: 0.036\n      unpruned_sft_math500: 0.524\n      unpruned_sft_humaneval: 0.549\n      recovery_ratio_gsm8k: 0.730\n      recovery_ratio_math500: 0.544\n      recovery_ratio_humaneval: 0.556\n      ood_degradation_pp: 18.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      Standard SFT从1%(post-prune)恢复到59.29%(GSM8K)看似impressive（+58pp），\n      但OOD evaluation揭示这部分recovery是GSM8K-specific。\n      MATH-500 28.5%（recovery ratio 54.4% vs GSM8K的73%）——MATH-500需要更复杂的\n      multi-step reasoning，pruning damage对这类task影响更大，且SFT on GSM8K gold\n      不能transfer reasoning chain construction ability to harder problems。\n      HumanEval 30.5%（ratio 55.6%）——code tasks需要不同的能力分布，GSM8K-specific SFT\n      不提供code generation ability恢复。\n      OOD degradation证明pruned model的SFT recovery部分是\"pattern reconstruction on GSM8K\"\n      而非\"genuine reasoning ability recovery\"。这为future work（multi-domain recovery data）\n      提供了动机。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 8: OOD evaluation — Standard SFT 20% on MATH-500 (28.5%) and HumanEval (30.5%)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix: Recovery ratio by benchmark bar chart\"\n    analysis: >\n      OOD eval在median tier下是contingency experiment（only needed if GRPO RASP advantage <5pp，\n      which it is: -0.84pp）。结果confirms SFT recovery的domain specificity。\n      Paper discussion中acknowledge: \"SFT recovery on in-domain data partially reconstructs\n      task-specific patterns rather than general reasoning capability.\"\n\n  - name: \"Qwen-Math-7B GRPO at 20% (re-run)\"\n    plan_id: \"scope_qwen_math_grpo_20\"\n    description: \"Qwen2.5-Math-7B上RASP/Standard 20%的GRPO训练，验证cross-model collapse\"\n    expected_results:\n      rasp_20_sft_ref: 0.725\n      standard_20_sft_ref: 0.710\n      rasp_20_grpo_collapse_step: 12\n      rasp_20_grpo_peak_reward: 0.028\n      rasp_20_grpo_final_frac_zero_std: 0.88\n      standard_20_grpo_collapse_step: 18\n      standard_20_grpo_peak_reward: 0.045\n      standard_20_grpo_final_frac_zero_std: 0.82\n      post_grpo_rasp_accuracy: 0.718\n      post_grpo_standard_accuracy: 0.705\n      collapse_ratio: 1.5\n      collapse_ratio_ci_95: [0.8, 2.8]\n      rasp_vs_standard_collapse_overlap: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Qwen-Math-7B与DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B虽然share Qwen2.5 backbone但training paradigm\n      不同——Qwen-Math是math-specific SFT，DeepSeek-R1-Distill是reasoning distillation。\n      两者的internal redundancy分布不同，导致RASP和Standard在Qwen-Math上的CKA-based\n      selection differential更小。\n      GRPO collapse在两者上都发生（confirming Claim 1 cross-model），但RASP step 12 vs Standard step 18\n      的ratio仅1.5x（vs DeepSeek的6x），且95% CI [0.8, 2.8]包含1——不显著。\n      这是因为Qwen-Math的math-specific training使层间redundancy更均匀分布，\n      RASP和Standard的pruning selection差异更小，导致collapse dynamics差异缩小。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 5: Cross-model results — Qwen-Math-7B GRPO collapse dynamics\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 8: Cross-model collapse timing comparison (DeepSeek vs Qwen-Math)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-model evidence confirms Claim 1（GRPO collapse在不同model上都发生），\n      但weakens Claim 2——collapse severity gradient在Qwen-Math上不clean。\n      Paper rewording: \"The collapse severity gradient is a diagnostic tendency observed\n      on DeepSeek-R1-Distill, with directionally consistent but not statistically significant\n      replication on Qwen2.5-Math-7B.\"\n\n  - name: \"Qwen-Math-7B GRPO at 25%\"\n    plan_id: \"scope_qwen_math_grpo_25\"\n    description: \"Qwen2.5-Math-7B上RASP/Standard 25%的GRPO训练\"\n    expected_results:\n      rasp_25_sft_ref: 0.64\n      standard_25_sft_ref: 0.63\n      rasp_25_grpo_collapse_step: 8\n      rasp_25_grpo_peak_reward: 0.015\n      rasp_25_grpo_final_frac_zero_std: 0.93\n      standard_25_grpo_collapse_step: 14\n      standard_25_grpo_peak_reward: 0.031\n      standard_25_grpo_final_frac_zero_std: 0.87\n      post_grpo_rasp_accuracy: 0.632\n      post_grpo_standard_accuracy: 0.624\n      collapse_ratio: 1.75\n      collapse_ratio_ci_95: [0.9, 3.1]\n    result_rationale: >\n      25%稀疏度在Qwen-Math上进一步加速collapse：RASP step 8, Standard step 14。\n      Ratio从1.5(20%)略增到1.75(25%)，因为higher sparsity使differential effects marginally stronger。\n      但CI仍包含1——RASP vs Standard的差异在cross-model设置下not significant。\n      SFT gap仅1pp（64% vs 63%），进一步confirm CKA-aware selection在不同model architecture\n      的internal redundancy distribution下不produce consistent advantage。\n      两者都collapse confirms GRPO failure的robustness across models and sparsity levels。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 5 新增25%行: Qwen-Math-7B 25% sparsity GRPO results\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 8 extended: 25% sparsity collapse timing for Qwen-Math\"\n    analysis: >\n      25% Qwen-Math结果与20%方向一致但仍not significant。\n      Paper conclusion: GRPO collapse is robust across models (Claim 1 strong),\n      but the severity gradient as a diagnostic tool requires further model diversity\n      to establish generality (Claim 2 hedged).\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":19944,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":19944},"output_tokens":22,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"54b1196c-8e84-4ebe-affe-21f57835ac0a","uuid":"764001ec-60de-4760-b1e6-7e9b912ccd8d"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":606936,"duration_api_ms":608406,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Claim 1（GRPO universal failure）是论文最强贡献——unpruned reward 0→0.661而accuracy 0pp变化已确认，\n  所有pruned配置叠加training collapse。Claim 2（collapse severity gradient）在主模型成立（RASP step~10 << Standard step~60），\n  但Qwen-Math-7B跨模型证据中RASP与Standard collapse步数重叠，需从\"clean diagnostic\"弱化为\"diagnostic tendency\"。\n  Claim 3（Redundancy-Stability Tradeoff）从fundamental principle降级为\"empirical observation on DeepSeek-R1 family\"——\n  25% SFT gap仅3-5pp（p~0.09），跨模型方向一致但分离度不够。论文仍可投EMNLP Main，但Discussion需诚实承认\n  generalization limitation。Unstructured pruning baseline（plan_017）是关键补充——structured pruning导致collapse而\n  unstructured不会，这直接支持structural damage hypothesis并回应Self-Healing comparison。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  - name: \"Post-prune baselines N=1319 (20%)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: \"将post-prune评估从N=100扩展到N=1319，获得±2.4pp CI用于论文Table 1\"\n    expected_results:\n      unpruned_original_accuracy: 0.854\n      unpruned_original_correct: 1127\n      unpruned_original_n: 1319\n      unpruned_original_stderr: 0.0097\n      rasp_20_postprune_accuracy: 0.298\n      rasp_20_postprune_correct: 393\n      rasp_20_postprune_stderr: 0.0126\n      rasp_20_eos_rate: 0.89\n      rasp_20_avg_len: 782\n      standard_20_postprune_accuracy: 0.261\n      standard_20_postprune_correct: 344\n      standard_20_postprune_stderr: 0.0121\n      standard_20_eos_rate: 0.82\n      standard_20_avg_len: 1145\n      rasp_vs_standard_gap_pp: 3.7\n      rasp_vs_standard_p_value: 0.034\n    result_rationale: >\n      N=100数据（RASP 31%, Standard 27%）的点估计在扩展到N=1319后预计小幅回落——\n      N=100的CI为±9pp，真值可能偏低。CI从±9pp收窄到±2.5pp后，3.7pp gap在post-prune阶段\n      达到弱显著（p=0.034），但这不是论文核心贡献。原始模型85.4%作为pruning damage的参照锚点。\n      Post-prune EOS率差异（RASP 89% vs Standard 82%）反映Standard对generation流畅性的更大破坏。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 1: Post-prune accuracy across methods — RASP 29.8% vs Standard 26.1% vs Unpruned 85.4%\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 2 bar chart第一组: Post-prune accuracy对比，三种方法+unpruned baseline\"\n    analysis: >\n      Post-prune gap（3.7pp）在N=1319下弱显著，确认RASP的CKA-aware selection保留了slightly more\n      functional capacity。但核心意义不在此——pruning后两者都丧失70%+能力，关键在recovery差异。\n\n  - name: \"All recovered models full eval N=1319\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: \"整合所有recovery路径的N=1319评估，构建论文核心Table 2\"\n    expected_results:\n      rasp_sft_accuracy: 0.6149\n      rasp_sft_correct: 811\n      standard_sft_accuracy: 0.5929\n      standard_sft_correct: 782\n      sft_gap_pp: 2.2\n      sft_gap_p_value: 0.25\n      rasp_grpo_step5_accuracy: 0.6065\n      rasp_grpo_step5_correct: 800\n      standard_grpo_step50_accuracy: 0.5891\n      standard_grpo_step50_correct: 777\n      unpruned_sft_accuracy: 0.8127\n      unpruned_grpo_step100_accuracy: 0.8127\n      unpruned_grpo_step100_correct: 1072\n      unpruned_grpo_delta_pp: 0.00\n      grpo_delta_rasp_pp: -0.84\n      grpo_delta_standard_pp: -0.38\n      grasp_sft_accuracy_n1319: 0.395\n      grasp_sft_correct_n1319: 521\n      grasp_grpo_accuracy_n1319: 0.388\n    result_rationale: >\n      已有数据已完整确认核心pattern: unpruned GRPO accuracy=SFT accuracy（1072/1319完全相同），\n      RASP和Standard GRPO均不优于SFT（甚至微降）。GRASPrune post-SFT从N=100的41%在N=1319\n      预计轻微下降至~39.5%（N=100 CI较宽）。GRASPrune post-GRPO预计~38.8%，同样无法从GRPO获益。\n      所有recovery路径都确认Claim 1: GRPO reward-accuracy decoupling is universal。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2: Recovery accuracy matrix — rows=method (RASP/Standard/GRASPrune/Unpruned), cols=recovery (Post-prune/SFT/GRPO)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 2 grouped bar chart: 4 methods × 3 recovery stages，展示pruning damage和recovery trajectory\"\n    analysis: >\n      核心发现已confirm: GRPO在所有配置下都不改善accuracy。SFT gap 2.2pp (p=0.25)不显著——\n      在median tier下报告为\"consistent trend\"而非\"significant result\"。GRASPrune作为external\n      baseline进一步strengthen Claim 1。\n\n  - name: \"GRASPrune full pipeline (20%)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: \"GRASPrune (ACL 2026 SOTA) 20%稀疏度完整pipeline: prune→eval→SFT→GRPO\"\n    expected_results:\n      postprune_accuracy_n1319: 0.068\n      postprune_correct: 90\n      postprune_eos_rate: 0.03\n      postprune_avg_len: 3950\n      post_sft_accuracy_n1319: 0.395\n      post_sft_correct: 521\n      post_sft_eos_rate: 0.96\n      grpo_collapse_step: 18\n      grpo_peak_reward: 0.012\n      grpo_peak_reward_step: 10\n      grpo_final_frac_zero_std: 0.92\n      grpo_final_grad_norm: 0.008\n      post_grpo_accuracy_n1319: 0.388\n      post_grpo_delta_vs_sft_pp: -0.7\n    result_rationale: >\n      GRASPrune的gate-based importance scoring造成最大structural damage（post-prune 7%），\n      因为gate training优化output preservation但不考虑结构冗余——它aggressive地同时移除了\n      important和redundant structures。SFT恢复到39.5%但远低于RASP(61.5%)/Standard(59.3%)，\n      因为deeper structural damage限制了SFT的function redistribution能力。\n      GRPO collapse在step~18，介于RASP(10)和Standard(60)之间——GRASPrune的gate training\n      意外保留了部分redundant结构（它们恰好有低gradient importance），所以比RASP慢collapse，\n      但远不如Standard，因为整体structural capacity太低（39.5% SFT baseline）。\n      Peak reward仅0.012（vs RASP 0.039, Standard 0.065），确认reward signal与starting accuracy相关。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2 新增行: GRASPrune — 6.8% / 39.5% / 38.8%\"\n      - \"Table 3 新增行: GRASPrune collapse step ~18, peak reward 0.012\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 1 新增曲线: GRASPrune GRPO training dynamics (reward, frac_zero_std vs step)\"\n      - \"Fig 2 新增组: GRASPrune recovery trajectory bar\"\n    analysis: >\n      GRASPrune作为ACL 2026 SOTA external baseline强化了论文的generality: 即使最先进的\n      structured pruning method也无法避免GRPO collapse。其collapse timing(step 18)处于\n      RASP(10)和Standard(60)之间，为Claim 2的severity gradient增加了第四个data point，\n      支持collapse速度与structural damage类型的关联性。\n\n  - name: \"Multi-seed post-prune eval (5 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: \"5个随机种子的post-prune评估，建立RASP vs Standard variance estimation\"\n    expected_results:\n      rasp_20_mean_accuracy: 0.304\n      rasp_20_std: 0.028\n      rasp_20_seed_results: [0.31, 0.28, 0.33, 0.29, 0.31]\n      standard_20_mean_accuracy: 0.265\n      standard_20_std: 0.032\n      standard_20_seed_results: [0.27, 0.24, 0.30, 0.22, 0.29]\n      pairwise_gap_mean_pp: 3.9\n      pairwise_gap_std: 2.1\n      paired_t_test_p: 0.024\n      cohen_d: 0.58\n      seeds_used: [42, 123, 456, 789, 1024]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Structured pruning对calibration data敏感——calibration batch的随机性影响哪些structures\n      被选中pruning。5个种子下RASP的variance（σ=2.8pp）略低于Standard（σ=3.2pp），因为\n      CKA-aware scoring提供了额外的稳定性信号（redundancy estimation跨seeds更一致）。\n      Paired t-test p=0.024达到显著，因为paired design消除了seed-level共变量。\n      但Cohen's d=0.58属于中等效应量，不足以称为\"strong advantage\"。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 1 supplement: Mean±std post-prune accuracy across 5 seeds\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix box plot: 5-seed post-prune accuracy distribution, RASP vs Standard\"\n    analysis: >\n      5-seed paired test达到显著（p=0.024），但效应量中等（d=0.58）。在median tier下\n      这支持\"RASP provides a consistent small advantage in structure selection\"，\n      但不足以成为论文主要卖点——核心贡献仍是GRPO collapse phenomenon。\n\n  - name: \"Scoring ablation (magnitude/gradient/random)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: \"20%稀疏度下magnitude-only、gradient-only、random pruning scoring对比\"\n    expected_results:\n      magnitude_only_accuracy: 0.24\n      magnitude_only_eos_rate: 0.78\n      gradient_only_accuracy: 0.28\n      gradient_only_eos_rate: 0.85\n      random_accuracy: 0.17\n      random_eos_rate: 0.45\n      random_avg_len: 2680\n      rasp_ref: 0.31\n      standard_ref: 0.27\n      ordering: \"RASP(31%) > gradient(28%) ≈ Standard(27%) > magnitude(24%) > random(17%)\"\n      cka_marginal_contribution_pp: 3.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Standard ≈ importance(gradient×magnitude)，所以gradient-only(28%)接近Standard(27%)——\n      magnitude信息对gradient已有的信号增量很小。Magnitude-only(24%)丢失了gradient的\n      task-specific信号，退化到只看权重大小。Random(17%)是下界——无信息选择。\n      RASP(31%)相对gradient-only(28%)的3pp增量就是CKA(functional redundancy)的marginal\n      contribution。这3pp很小但方向一致，说明CKA提供了互补但non-dominant的信号。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 6: Scoring ablation — Random(17%) < Magnitude(24%) < Gradient(28%) ≈ Standard(27%) < RASP(31%)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 3 ablation bar chart: 5种scoring方法的post-prune accuracy对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      CKA的marginal contribution仅3pp，说明在post-prune阶段CKA是helpful but not decisive的\n      补充信号。核心pruning quality仍由gradient/importance决定。CKA的关键价值在GRPO collapse\n      differential（Claim 2）而非post-prune accuracy（Claim 3的弱化体现）。\n\n  - name: \"CKA-recoverability correlation analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: \"Per-head F(h) vs post-recovery activation change的mixed-effects regression\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_pearson_r: 0.38\n      overall_p_value: 0.003\n      within_layer_r: 0.22\n      within_layer_p: 0.041\n      between_layer_variance_explained: 0.62\n      within_layer_variance_explained: 0.08\n      mixed_effects_fixed_slope: 0.31\n      mixed_effects_random_intercept_sd: 0.18\n      layer_icc: 0.71\n      control_weight_norm_partial_r: 0.12\n      control_grad_importance_partial_r: 0.15\n      n_heads_analyzed: 224\n    result_rationale: >\n      F(h)（CKA-based functional redundancy score）在层间水平与recovery后activation change\n      显著相关（r=0.38），因为不同层的redundancy基线差异大——早期层功能高度冗余，深层更specialized。\n      但within-layer的预测力弱（r=0.22），因为同层内heads的redundancy差异小，\n      局部connectivity和positional encoding效应主导了recovery dynamics。\n      Layer ICC=0.71意味着71%的variance在层间，仅29%在层内。这解释了为什么CKA-aware pruning\n      （RASP）在post-prune阶段只提供marginal advantage——大部分可利用的信号在层级选择，\n      而RASP和Standard在层级分配上差异不大（都优先剪浅层MLP）。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 9 (Appendix): Mixed-effects regression coefficients\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 4: Scatter plot of F(h) vs ΔActivation, colored by layer depth, with regression line\"\n      - \"Appendix: ICC by layer bar chart\"\n    analysis: >\n      CKA作为recoverability predictor在macro level有效但micro level较弱。\n      这直接支持Claim 3的弱化版本——CKA captures a real signal（r=0.38, p=0.003），\n      但不足以成为\"fundamental principle\"级别的predictor。报告为\"CKA identifies a meaningful\n      but layer-dominated redundancy signal\"。\n\n  - name: \"SFT-only recovery comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: \"RASP vs Standard在SFT-only recovery下的对比（无GRPO）\"\n    expected_results:\n      rasp_sft_20_accuracy: 0.6149\n      standard_sft_20_accuracy: 0.5929\n      sft_gap_20_pp: 2.2\n      sft_gap_20_p_value: 0.25\n      rasp_sft_20_loss_final: 0.64\n      standard_sft_20_loss_final: 0.64\n      rasp_sft_20_token_acc: 0.83\n      standard_sft_20_token_acc: 0.83\n      learning_curve_crossover_step: null\n      convergence_step_rasp: 1400\n      convergence_step_standard: 1350\n    result_rationale: >\n      SFT-only数据已有（RASP 61.49%, Standard 59.29%, gap 2.2pp, p=0.25）。\n      两者训练dynamics几乎完全相同——final loss 0.64, token accuracy 83%——表明\n      SFT的teacher-forcing机制能equally well地利用不同pruning scheme保留的结构。\n      CKA-aware pruning在SFT recovery中的advantage是marginal的：SFT通过梯度下降\n      重新分配功能到remaining structures，不太依赖原始redundancy patterns。\n      Gap方向一致（RASP > Standard）但magnitude不足以达到significance at N=1319。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2 SFT-only列: RASP 61.5% vs Standard 59.3% (p=0.25)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix: SFT training loss curves对比 (RASP vs Standard, nearly identical)\"\n    analysis: >\n      SFT-only comparison确认Claim 3的一半：SFT recovery下RASP advantage是marginal。\n      与GRPO collapse的dramatic差异形成对比——optimal pruning确实depends on recovery paradigm，\n      但SFT方向的evidence弱于GRPO方向。\n\n  - name: \"25% sparsity full pipeline\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: \"25%稀疏度RASP+Standard完整pipeline (prune→SFT→GRPO)，验证sparsity scaling\"\n    expected_results:\n      postprune_rasp_25: 0.21\n      postprune_standard_25: 0.16\n      sft_rasp_25_accuracy: 0.5449\n      sft_rasp_25_correct: 719\n      sft_rasp_25_stderr: 0.0137\n      sft_standard_25_accuracy: 0.5125\n      sft_standard_25_correct: 676\n      sft_gap_25_pp: 3.24\n      sft_gap_25_p_value: 0.089\n      grpo_rasp_25_collapse_step: 7\n      grpo_rasp_25_peak_reward: 0.018\n      grpo_rasp_25_peak_frac_zero_std: 0.97\n      grpo_rasp_25_final_grad_norm: 0.005\n      grpo_standard_25_collapse_step: 30\n      grpo_standard_25_peak_reward: 0.042\n      grpo_standard_25_step30_frac_zero_std: 0.72\n      grpo_standard_25_transient_recovery: false\n      grpo_standard_25_final_reward: 0.028\n      post_grpo_rasp_25_accuracy: 0.535\n      post_grpo_standard_25_accuracy: 0.505\n      collapse_ratio_rasp_vs_standard: 4.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      25%稀疏度放大所有效应：\n      (1) SFT gap从2.2pp扩大到3.24pp（p=0.089）——更多结构移除使RASP的CKA-aware selection\n      产生更大differential effect，但p仍在[0.05,0.15]范围内，属于marginal。\n      (2) GRPO collapse加速——RASP从step~10降到step~7，Standard从step~60降到step~30。\n      两者都因更少structural capacity而更快collapse。但ratio从6x(20%)降到4.3x(25%)，\n      因为Standard在25%下也开始失去redundancy，两者向同一个floor convergence。\n      (3) Standard在25%下不再有transient recovery（20%时step~60 dip后recovered to step~90）——\n      25%的structural capacity不足以支持recovery。\n      这是median tier的核心: collapse gradient存在但\"不如20%那么干净\"。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 1 新增25%行: RASP 21%→54.5%→53.5%, Standard 16%→51.3%→50.5%\"\n      - \"Table 3 新增25%行: collapse steps and dynamics\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 1 新增panel: 25% GRPO training dynamics (reward, frac_zero_std curves)\"\n      - \"Fig 5: Collapse step vs sparsity level line plot (20% and 25%, RASP vs Standard)\"\n    analysis: >\n      25%数据是Claim 2的关键支撑——collapse severity gradient在两个sparsity levels上成立。\n      但ratio compression（6x→4.3x）和Standard失去recovery能力说明gradient在高sparsity下变noisy。\n      SFT gap 3.24pp（p=0.089）是论文能报告的最强SFT evidence——在median tier下报告为\n      \"marginally significant trend (p<0.1) that amplifies with sparsity\"。\n\n  - name: \"30% sparsity probe (prune + eval only)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: \"30%稀疏度RASP+Standard post-prune评估，mapping practical sparsity ceiling\"\n    expected_results:\n      rasp_30_postprune_accuracy: 0.12\n      rasp_30_postprune_stderr: 0.032\n      rasp_30_eos_rate: 0.38\n      rasp_30_avg_len: 2850\n      standard_30_postprune_accuracy: 0.09\n      standard_30_postprune_stderr: 0.029\n      standard_30_eos_rate: 0.31\n      standard_30_avg_len: 3200\n      gap_pp: 3.0\n      gap_p_value: 0.48\n    result_rationale: >\n      30%稀疏度接近structured pruning的实际上限——从25%(RASP 21%, Standard 16%)到30%，\n      accuracy再降约50%。两者都接近random chance on GSM8K（~10-12%可能仅靠简单算术题得分）。\n      EOS率极低（RASP 38%, Standard 31%）表明模型generation能力严重受损，大量输出截断。\n      Gap（3pp）在这个低accuracy下无统计意义（p=0.48），因为variance极大。\n      与D005的35%结果（total collapse）一致——30%是collapse onset，35%是complete failure。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 1 新增30%行: RASP 12% vs Standard 9% (post-prune only)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 5 extended: Sparsity vs post-prune accuracy curve (20%, 25%, 30%), marking practical ceiling\"\n    analysis: >\n      确认~25-30%为DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B的structured pruning practical ceiling。\n      不进行recovery实验因为starting point太低（<15%）。Paper discussion中报告为\n      \"structured pruning beyond 25% is impractical for this model class\"。\n\n  - name: \"Extended eval (MMLU, HumanEval, MATH-500)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: \"最佳recovered config (RASP SFT 20%) + unpruned在三个OOD benchmark上的评估\"\n    expected_results:\n      rasp_sft_20_math500: 0.318\n      rasp_sft_20_humaneval: 0.354\n      rasp_sft_20_mmlu: 0.512\n      standard_sft_20_math500: 0.298\n      standard_sft_20_humaneval: 0.329\n      standard_sft_20_mmlu: 0.498\n      unpruned_sft_math500: 0.524\n      unpruned_sft_humaneval: 0.549\n      unpruned_sft_mmlu: 0.638\n      unpruned_original_math500: 0.558\n      unpruned_original_humaneval: 0.561\n      unpruned_original_mmlu: 0.651\n      recovery_ratio_gsm8k: 0.757\n      recovery_ratio_math500: 0.607\n      recovery_ratio_humaneval: 0.645\n      recovery_ratio_mmlu: 0.803\n    result_rationale: >\n      SFT recovery在GSM8K上恢复到75.7%（RASP 61.5% / Unpruned 81.3%），但OOD benchmark\n      恢复率显著更低：MATH-500仅60.7%，HumanEval 64.5%。这是因为SFT teacher-forcing使用\n      GSM8K gold solutions，recovery部分是GSM8K-specific pattern重建而非通用reasoning能力恢复。\n      MMLU恢复率最高(80.3%)因为factual knowledge主要存储在embedding层和attention patterns中，\n      structured pruning主要移除MLP groups（占pruned structures的100%），对factual recall影响较小。\n      RASP vs Standard gap在OOD上方向一致但magnitude更小（MATH-500: 2pp, MMLU: 1.4pp），\n      说明CKA-aware selection的advantage部分是GSM8K-specific的。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 8: Extended eval — accuracy by benchmark and method\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 6 (Appendix): Recovery ratio by benchmark grouped bar chart\"\n    analysis: >\n      OOD evaluation reveals SFT recovery的domain specificity。核心message: pruned model\n      recovers 75%+ capability on in-domain (GSM8K) but only 60-65% on harder math/code tasks。\n      这strengthens the argument for better recovery methods——current SFT pipeline有inherent limitation。\n      对Claim 3补充了nuance: RASP advantage在OOD上diminishes。\n\n  - name: \"Bonsai baseline (20%)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: \"Bonsai (ICML 2025, gradient-free) 20%稀疏度作为第三个external baseline\"\n    expected_results:\n      postprune_accuracy_n100: 0.19\n      postprune_eos_rate: 0.52\n      post_sft_accuracy_n100: 0.47\n      post_sft_eos_rate: 0.95\n      grpo_collapse_step: 28\n      grpo_peak_reward: 0.022\n      grpo_final_frac_zero_std: 0.88\n      post_grpo_accuracy_n100: 0.46\n    result_rationale: >\n      Bonsai用activation norm作为pruning criterion（gradient-free），post-prune 19%介于\n      random(17%)和Standard(27%)之间——activation norm是importance的粗略proxy但不如gradient准确。\n      SFT恢复到47%，高于GRASPrune(41%)但低于Standard(59%)，因为Bonsai的structure selection\n      质量介于random和gradient-based之间。\n      GRPO collapse at step~28——比GRASPrune(18)慢因为Bonsai的简单norm-based selection\n      意外保留了更多redundant structures（redundant structures often have moderate norms），\n      但比Standard(60)快因为overall pruning quality更差。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2 新增行 (Appendix): Bonsai — 19% / 47% / 46%\"\n      - \"Table 3 新增行 (Appendix): Bonsai collapse step ~28\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix: Bonsai training dynamics curve\"\n    analysis: >\n      Bonsai作为gradient-free baseline补全了pruning method spectrum。四种方法的collapse ordering\n      (RASP 10 < GRASPrune 18 < Bonsai 28 < Standard 60)进一步支持Claim 2: collapse速度\n      与pruning method的redundancy removal aggressive度相关。但Bonsai是P2优先级——\n      如果GPU budget紧张可以drop，GRASPrune足以作为external baseline。\n\n  - name: \"CKA reliability analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: \"Split-half consistency和calibration size sensitivity验证CKA scoring稳定性\"\n    expected_results:\n      split_half_spearman_rho: 0.93\n      split_half_p_value: 1.0e-45\n      cal_256_spearman_rho: 0.88\n      cal_512_spearman_rho: 0.93\n      cal_1024_spearman_rho: 0.95\n      cal_256_accuracy_delta_vs_512: -0.015\n      cal_1024_accuracy_delta_vs_512: 0.008\n      n_structures_scored: 896\n      scoring_time_256_sec: 180\n      scoring_time_512_sec: 340\n      scoring_time_1024_sec: 660\n    result_rationale: >\n      CKA是kernel-based similarity metric，理论上convergence rate为O(1/√n)——512 samples\n      已足够达到ρ>0.9。Split-half consistency ρ=0.93表明在random half-split下scoring order\n      高度稳定。256→512的提升（0.88→0.93）是主要增量，512→1024仅marginal（0.93→0.95），\n      说明512是cost-effective minimum。\n      Accuracy delta确认scoring stability translates to pruning outcome stability:\n      cal=256 vs cal=512仅相差1.5pp post-prune accuracy，cal=1024 vs 512仅0.8pp。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 10 (Appendix): CKA reliability by calibration size\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix: Spearman ρ vs calibration size curve\"\n    analysis: >\n      CKA scoring在512 samples下已稳定（ρ=0.93），支持RASP的practical usability。\n      这是一个defensive result——reviewer可能质疑CKA computation的稳定性，\n      该实验提供conclusive evidence that CKA-based scoring is reliable。\n\n  - name: \"Alpha sensitivity ablation (full)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: \"α ∈ {0, 0.25, 0.5, 1, 2} post-prune和post-SFT accuracy sweep\"\n    expected_results:\n      postprune:\n        alpha_0p0: 0.27\n        alpha_0p25: 0.23\n        alpha_0p5: 0.22\n        alpha_1p0: 0.31\n        alpha_2p0: 0.36\n      post_sft_n1319:\n        alpha_0p0: 0.593\n        alpha_0p25: 0.558\n        alpha_0p5: 0.549\n        alpha_1p0: 0.573\n        alpha_2p0: 0.608\n      post_sft_n100_ref:\n        alpha_0p0: 0.64\n        alpha_0p25: null\n        alpha_0p5: null\n        alpha_1p0: 0.57\n        alpha_2p0: 0.62\n      u_shape_minimum_alpha: 0.5\n      optimal_postprune_alpha: 2.0\n      optimal_postsft_alpha: 2.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Post-prune U-shape已由alpha_ablation_sweep确认（α=0.5最低22%, α=2.0最高36%）。\n      Post-SFT结果部分已有（N=100）——在N=1319下预计：\n      α=0.0(=Standard)→59.3%（已确认），α=1.0→57.3%（从N=100的57%微调），α=2.0→60.8%（从N=100的62%微调）。\n      Post-SFT的U-shape被SFT recovery压缩但保留方向——α=2.0在SFT后仍最优，因为它在post-prune\n      阶段保留了最多functional capacity（36%），给SFT更好的starting point。\n      α=0.25和α=0.5的post-SFT较低是因为它们在post-prune阶段创造了\"noise injection\"效果——\n      CKA penalty太小时反而干扰了importance ranking而不是有效补充。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 4: Alpha ablation — post-prune and post-SFT accuracy across α values\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 3: U-shape curve, dual y-axis (post-prune and post-SFT accuracy vs α)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Alpha ablation是reviewer flagged的Critical experiment。U-shape confirms α是meaningful parameter，\n      不是arbitrary choice。最优α=2.0（非default 1.0）→paper应report this transparently并\n      讨论为什么aggressive CKA penalty有利（推测：更强地保护unique structures在reasoning LLM中更关键）。\n      Post-SFT U-shape压缩但保留说明CKA contribution survives recovery——与plan_008的CKA-recoverability\n      correlation一致。\n\n  - name: \"Inference speedup benchmark\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_016\"\n    description: \"Dense vs 20% RASP-pruned vs 20% Standard-pruned wall-clock latency和throughput\"\n    expected_results:\n      dense_latency_ms: 142\n      rasp_20_latency_ms: 121\n      standard_20_latency_ms: 120\n      rasp_20_latency_reduction_pct: 14.8\n      standard_20_latency_reduction_pct: 15.5\n      dense_throughput_tok_s: 85\n      rasp_20_throughput_tok_s: 99\n      standard_20_throughput_tok_s: 100\n      rasp_20_throughput_gain_pct: 16.5\n      standard_20_throughput_gain_pct: 17.6\n      batch_size: 1\n      seq_len: 512\n      gpu: \"A100-80GB\"\n      n_runs: 50\n      warmup_runs: 10\n    result_rationale: >\n      20% structured pruning移除~19%的parameters（全部是complete MLP groups），理论speedup为19%。\n      实际latency reduction ~15%因为：(1)非MLP compute（attention, LayerNorm, embedding）不变，\n      占总compute的~25%；(2)不同层的pruning不均匀导致GPU utilization不optimal；\n      (3)framework overhead（PyTorch dynamic shapes）。RASP和Standard的speedup几乎相同\n      因为sparsity level相同——pruning method影响which structures被移除，不影响total removal量。\n      Standard微略快（0.7pp）可能是随机variation或因为Standard pruned的structures恰好使\n      layer sizes更uniform。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 7: Inference speedup — latency and throughput comparison\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix: Latency distribution box plot across 50 runs\"\n    analysis: >\n      ~15% speedup在20% sparsity下是reasonable但不impressive——structured pruning的practical motivation\n      需要至少25-30% sparsity才能达到meaningful speedup。但这个experiment是reviewer必问的\n      \"where's the efficiency gain\"的defensive answer。Paper discussion应note that \n      structured pruning实际speedup低于parameter reduction ratio。\n\n  - name: \"Unstructured pruning baseline (20%)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_017\"\n    description: \"Magnitude-based unstructured pruning 20%作为Self-Healing fair comparison基线\"\n    expected_results:\n      postprune_accuracy: 0.682\n      postprune_correct: 900\n      postprune_n: 1319\n      postprune_stderr: 0.0128\n      postprune_eos_rate: 0.98\n      post_sft_accuracy: 0.763\n      post_sft_correct: 1007\n      post_sft_stderr: 0.0117\n      grpo_collapse: false\n      grpo_max_steps: 100\n      grpo_final_reward: 0.548\n      grpo_final_frac_zero_std: 0.32\n      grpo_final_grad_norm: 5.82\n      post_grpo_accuracy: 0.758\n      post_grpo_delta_vs_sft_pp: -0.5\n      grpo_reward_accuracy_decoupling: true\n      structured_vs_unstructured_gap_postprune_pp: 38.4\n      structured_vs_unstructured_gap_postsft_pp: 14.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      Unstructured pruning at 20%仅零化individual weights而不移除structural units——所有224个attention heads和\n      784个MLP groups保持intact。Post-prune 68.2%远高于structured的30%(RASP)/27%(Standard)，\n      因为每个结构仍有80%的weights functional，network topology完全保留。\n      SFT恢复到76.3%——接近unpruned(81.3%)，gap仅5pp，因为结构完整性使SFT只需微调权重而非重建功能。\n      GRPO关键发现：NO COLLAPSE。100步训练stable（frac_zero_std<0.35, grad_norm~5.8），\n      reward达到0.548（vs unpruned 0.661）。但accuracy仍不改善（76.3→75.8, Δ=-0.5pp）——\n      reward-accuracy decoupling在unstructured pruned model上也成立（Claim 1 strengthened），\n      但没有training collapse。\n      这直接支持structural damage hypothesis: collapse是structural pruning的specific consequence\n      （移除entire exploration pathways），不是pruning in general的问题。Unstructured pruning\n      保留了所有structural redundancy，因此GRPO可以stable训练。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2 新增行: Unstructured 20% — 68.2% / 76.3% / 75.8%\"\n      - \"Table 3 新增行: Unstructured — no collapse, 100 steps stable\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 1 新增panel: Unstructured GRPO dynamics (stable reward, no frac_zero_std spike)\"\n      - \"Fig 7: Structured vs Unstructured comparison — collapse is structural-pruning-specific\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是median tier最关键的补充实验。Unstructured pruning确认了两个核心insights:\n      (1) Reward-accuracy decoupling is universal（连unstructured也有reward↑ accuracy=），strengthening Claim 1;\n      (2) Training collapse is structural-pruning-specific（unstructured无collapse），confirming\n      the structural damage mechanism。\n      对Self-Healing comparison: Self-Healing用25% unstructured报告recovery——我们在20% unstructured\n      也看到无collapse，但accuracy仍不从GRPO获益。Paper可argue: Self-Healing的\"RLVR recovery\"\n      可能只是reward improvement without accuracy gain，需要replication with accuracy evaluation。\n\n  - name: \"SFT OOD eval (Standard 20%)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_018\"\n    description: \"Standard SFT 20% (59.29% GSM8K)在MATH-500和HumanEval上的OOD评估\"\n    expected_results:\n      standard_sft_20_math500: 0.285\n      standard_sft_20_math500_stderr: 0.020\n      standard_sft_20_humaneval: 0.305\n      standard_sft_20_humaneval_stderr: 0.036\n      unpruned_sft_math500: 0.524\n      unpruned_sft_humaneval: 0.549\n      recovery_ratio_gsm8k: 0.730\n      recovery_ratio_math500: 0.544\n      recovery_ratio_humaneval: 0.556\n      ood_degradation_pp: 18.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      Standard SFT从1%(post-prune)恢复到59.29%(GSM8K)看似impressive（+58pp），\n      但OOD evaluation揭示这部分recovery是GSM8K-specific。\n      MATH-500 28.5%（recovery ratio 54.4% vs GSM8K的73%）——MATH-500需要更复杂的\n      multi-step reasoning，pruning damage对这类task影响更大，且SFT on GSM8K gold\n      不能transfer reasoning chain construction ability to harder problems。\n      HumanEval 30.5%（ratio 55.6%）——code tasks需要不同的能力分布，GSM8K-specific SFT\n      不提供code generation ability恢复。\n      OOD degradation证明pruned model的SFT recovery部分是\"pattern reconstruction on GSM8K\"\n      而非\"genuine reasoning ability recovery\"。这为future work（multi-domain recovery data）\n      提供了动机。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 8: OOD evaluation — Standard SFT 20% on MATH-500 (28.5%) and HumanEval (30.5%)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix: Recovery ratio by benchmark bar chart\"\n    analysis: >\n      OOD eval在median tier下是contingency experiment（only needed if GRPO RASP advantage <5pp，\n      which it is: -0.84pp）。结果confirms SFT recovery的domain specificity。\n      Paper discussion中acknowledge: \"SFT recovery on in-domain data partially reconstructs\n      task-specific patterns rather than general reasoning capability.\"\n\n  - name: \"Qwen-Math-7B GRPO at 20% (re-run)\"\n    plan_id: \"scope_qwen_math_grpo_20\"\n    description: \"Qwen2.5-Math-7B上RASP/Standard 20%的GRPO训练，验证cross-model collapse\"\n    expected_results:\n      rasp_20_sft_ref: 0.725\n      standard_20_sft_ref: 0.710\n      rasp_20_grpo_collapse_step: 12\n      rasp_20_grpo_peak_reward: 0.028\n      rasp_20_grpo_final_frac_zero_std: 0.88\n      standard_20_grpo_collapse_step: 18\n      standard_20_grpo_peak_reward: 0.045\n      standard_20_grpo_final_frac_zero_std: 0.82\n      post_grpo_rasp_accuracy: 0.718\n      post_grpo_standard_accuracy: 0.705\n      collapse_ratio: 1.5\n      collapse_ratio_ci_95: [0.8, 2.8]\n      rasp_vs_standard_collapse_overlap: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Qwen-Math-7B与DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B虽然share Qwen2.5 backbone但training paradigm\n      不同——Qwen-Math是math-specific SFT，DeepSeek-R1-Distill是reasoning distillation。\n      两者的internal redundancy分布不同，导致RASP和Standard在Qwen-Math上的CKA-based\n      selection differential更小。\n      GRPO collapse在两者上都发生（confirming Claim 1 cross-model），但RASP step 12 vs Standard step 18\n      的ratio仅1.5x（vs DeepSeek的6x），且95% CI [0.8, 2.8]包含1——不显著。\n      这是因为Qwen-Math的math-specific training使层间redundancy更均匀分布，\n      RASP和Standard的pruning selection差异更小，导致collapse dynamics差异缩小。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 5: Cross-model results — Qwen-Math-7B GRPO collapse dynamics\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 8: Cross-model collapse timing comparison (DeepSeek vs Qwen-Math)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-model evidence confirms Claim 1（GRPO collapse在不同model上都发生），\n      但weakens Claim 2——collapse severity gradient在Qwen-Math上不clean。\n      Paper rewording: \"The collapse severity gradient is a diagnostic tendency observed\n      on DeepSeek-R1-Distill, with directionally consistent but not statistically significant\n      replication on Qwen2.5-Math-7B.\"\n\n  - name: \"Qwen-Math-7B GRPO at 25%\"\n    plan_id: \"scope_qwen_math_grpo_25\"\n    description: \"Qwen2.5-Math-7B上RASP/Standard 25%的GRPO训练\"\n    expected_results:\n      rasp_25_sft_ref: 0.64\n      standard_25_sft_ref: 0.63\n      rasp_25_grpo_collapse_step: 8\n      rasp_25_grpo_peak_reward: 0.015\n      rasp_25_grpo_final_frac_zero_std: 0.93\n      standard_25_grpo_collapse_step: 14\n      standard_25_grpo_peak_reward: 0.031\n      standard_25_grpo_final_frac_zero_std: 0.87\n      post_grpo_rasp_accuracy: 0.632\n      post_grpo_standard_accuracy: 0.624\n      collapse_ratio: 1.75\n      collapse_ratio_ci_95: [0.9, 3.1]\n    result_rationale: >\n      25%稀疏度在Qwen-Math上进一步加速collapse：RASP step 8, Standard step 14。\n      Ratio从1.5(20%)略增到1.75(25%)，因为higher sparsity使differential effects marginally stronger。\n      但CI仍包含1——RASP vs Standard的差异在cross-model设置下not significant。\n      SFT gap仅1pp（64% vs 63%），进一步confirm CKA-aware selection在不同model architecture\n      的internal redundancy distribution下不produce consistent advantage。\n      两者都collapse confirms GRPO failure的robustness across models and sparsity levels。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 5 新增25%行: Qwen-Math-7B 25% sparsity GRPO results\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 8 extended: 25% sparsity collapse timing for Qwen-Math\"\n    analysis: >\n      25% Qwen-Math结果与20%方向一致但仍not significant。\n      Paper conclusion: GRPO collapse is robust across models (Claim 1 strong),\n      but the severity gradient as a diagnostic tool requires further model diversity\n      to establish generality (Claim 2 hedged).\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"54b1196c-8e84-4ebe-affe-21f57835ac0a","total_cost_usd":0.9303285,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":19944,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"ou